	"notice": "Connect via USB and select the input in the host. Use the QuNeo editor to set sensitivity, pads, sliders and rotary assignments. For a KMI MIDI Expander, use the documented Expander mode. Touch surfaces provide an alternative control method, but this is not a promise of suitability for every access need. This discontinued model remains listed for existing hardware; mappings vary by preset and firmware. Select the profile manually if the host does not identify it: no unverified port aliases are supplied. Diagrams are original simplified schematics, not scale drawings. Physical controls without a binding are informational; use MIDI learn for configurable assignments.",
